       <property name="whatsThis">
        <string>Enter the criterion to filter the selection.
The criterion is entered as a formula:
&gt; - greater than
&lt; - less than
&gt;= - greater than or equal
&lt;= - less than or equal
= - equal
Example:
&gt; 30 will show all records strictly greater than 30
It's best to separate the number from the sign with a space.</string>
